  "warnings": [],
  "narrative": "The two probe tubes agree within \u22481.5 dB when both are in the ear, with the measurement probe reading slightly lower; the bias grows towards 8 kHz. Inserting the measurement probe reduces the low-frequency driver output (\u0394Hha < 0), most strongly for the nugget earmold, and increases the leakage of external sound (\u0394REOIG > 0), most strongly for the nugget and closed earmolds. Threshold differences at 125 Hz confirm the effect for all families and extend it to domes, where no reference probe exists. These directions reproduce the source study and validate the validity model implemented in AcousticBench.",
